<body>
    <h1>Task Module =E2=80=93 Combined Requirements (MOM + Interview Summar=
y)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"61aafa276e1f"><strong>Prepared for: </strong>Engage =
/ Field &amp; Web Teams</p>
<p local-id=3D"ec13b4fc6175"><strong>Prepared by: </strong>Arumugam V =E2=
=80=93 Principal UX Engineer I</p>
<p local-id=3D"78f117f987ae"><strong>Last updated: </strong>25 Feb 2026</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"c3e974f384f3" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-1.Overview">1. Overview</h1>
<p local-id=3D"8f0cf08d037d">This document consolidates all Task Module req=
uirements derived from the uploaded Minutes of Meeting (MOM) and the Interv=
iew Summary. It focuses on end-to-end task lifecycle, roles and permissions=
, dashboard behaviors, SLA/escalation logic, interaction patterns, and audi=
t/compliance needs.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"9ed6dc9904b0" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-2.Objectives&amp;Scope">2. Objectives &amp; Scope</h=
1>
<p local-id=3D"b24a225fc36e"><strong>Objectives</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7b88497d9192">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Provide a clear, efficient workflow for creating, viewing, acting =
on, and closing operational tasks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"883f15d88a9f">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Ensure tasks influence utilisation and SLA tracking where appropri=
ate.</p>
<p local-id=3D"556514408b35">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Support managerial oversight, auditability, and process improvemen=
t via structured reasons and analytics.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9329d16355e2"><strong>In Scope</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"cc42af2bebd2">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Web task dashboard and detail views</p>
<p local-id=3D"9545200a8650">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Task lifecycle &amp; statuses, actions, and audit trail</p>
<p local-id=3D"867dc7b55350">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;SLA definitions, escalation rules, and metrics</p>
<p local-id=3D"d764de49bb24">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Search/filtering, manager/admin views, and reporting</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"f44147b291d2" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-3.UserRoles">3. User Roles</h1>
<p local-id=3D"c656c4acb91b"><strong>Primary roles:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"cc4b7fe8aa8f">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Agent/Assignee =E2=80=93 works tasks, updates status, adds comment=
s/evidence.</p>
<p local-id=3D"05364c046073">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Manager =E2=80=93 monitors SLA, reallocates work, views area-wide =
tasks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c2fd3d03a1bc">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Admin =E2=80=93 global visibility across business areas with confi=
guration access (SLA values, rules).</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"cd473bc8a018" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-4.TaskLifecycle&amp;Statuses">4. Task Lifecycle &amp=
; Statuses</h1>
<p local-id=3D"1aa5930a6d4d">Statuses supported: New, In Progress, Reassign=
ed, Reprioritized, Escalated, Cancelled, Completed. Active screens show onl=
y open tasks; completed and outcome states are moved to the Completed secti=
on for audit. When a user opens a task, status cannot remain New=E2=80=94an=
 explicit status update is required before exiting.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"ad93b7544680" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-5.CoreActions&amp;Rules">5. Core Actions &amp; Rules=
</h1>
<p local-id=3D"824bee10d24e"><strong>Complete</strong>: Marks task done and=
 removes it from active list; appears under Completed for audit.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9c6a8c0f2429"><strong>Reject</strong>: Requires a structured=
 reason via guided questions; used when task is invalid or not actionable. =
Adds to analytics on rejection causes.</p>
<p local-id=3D"418d7dbe20cd"><strong>Reassign</strong>: Delegation via reas=
signment with mandatory comment; ownership remains traceable through audit =
trail. Separate =E2=80=9CCreate Action=E2=80=9D is not needed as reassignme=
nt covers delegation.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e43acc309749"><strong>Mark In Progress</strong>: Used when i=
mmediate resolution is not possible; SLA timer continues. Mandatory comment=
 required; overdue in-progress tasks should be visibly highlighted.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"3ca93c179e66" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-6.Escalation&amp;SLABehaviour">6. Escalation &amp; S=
LA Behaviour</h1>
<p local-id=3D"2b675b9d938e">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Hierarchical escalation when tasks remain unresolved beyond config=
ured duration; uses organisational reporting lines.</p>
<p local-id=3D"299ccc5051f1">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;SLA categories: Within SLA, Approaching SLA (near threshold), Past=
 SLA (breached). Thresholds are configurable by priority (e.g., last 30 min=
 of a 4-hour SLA =3D Approaching).</p>
<p local-id=3D"a5748c897afc">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Changes to SLA values require confirmation and are fully audited (=
who/what/when/why).</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"eee1653e36ba" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-7.Dashboard,Metrics&amp;Views">7. Dashboard, Metrics=
 &amp; Views</h1>
<p local-id=3D"69e1107e7cea">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Dashboard metrics: Total tasks, Inside SLA, Approaching SLA, Past =
SLA; similar to Jobs at Risk behaviour.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9ee0e053b002">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Manager view: see all outstanding tasks, SLA proximity, workload a=
cross business area(s).</p>
<p local-id=3D"517c991f794f">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Admin view: holistic visibility across all business areas with fil=
ters (e.g., Metering, Motor, Field).</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"ac789c82fa23" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-8.InteractionDesign&amp;Layout">8. Interaction Desig=
n &amp; Layout</h1>
<p local-id=3D"36201d7fa2b1">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Default to list/linear layout with initial collapsed task cards; e=
xpand to reveal full actions. Grid views can confuse reading order for oper=
ational usage.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e0074173d5cc">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Provide clear Complete / Reject CTA grouping. Add optional Snooze/=
Dismiss with reason if required by operations (non-blocking).</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"1d31a275cd9a" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-9.Search&amp;Filtering">9. Search &amp; Filtering</h=
1>
<p local-id=3D"4d492ed95b9a">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Search by Agent name, Task name, Task type, Status, Assigned perso=
nnel, Overdue flag.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d775a7554f03">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Provide quick filters consistent with existing web application beh=
aviour for parity.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"f16cad4d4aca" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-10.TaskCreation(WebUsers)">10. Task Creation (Web Us=
ers)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"ddc8c3f9a6be">Managers/Web users can manually create tasks w=
ith comments and assignment. These ad-hoc tasks may not include deep system=
 links and primarily act as operational instructions.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"15b743577e36" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-11.Ownership,AuditTrail&amp;Compliance">11. Ownershi=
p, Audit Trail &amp; Compliance</h1>
<p local-id=3D"21892efb7754">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Every state change/comment/reassignment is recorded with user, tim=
estamp, and reason where applicable.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5480640e0e24">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Maintain visibility of lifecycle history to ensure accountability =
even when tasks are reassigned.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"5144b3021b33" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-12.FieldAppIntegration(LightweightOption)">12. Field=
 App Integration (Lightweight Option)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"f5cc42596d87">Feasibility to notify field users and allow si=
mple completion acknowledgement without a full mobile task module to be exp=
lored; timeline impact to be validated.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"cef35c9ac8de" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-13.CompletedSectionMetrics&amp;Analytics">13. Comple=
ted Section Metrics &amp; Analytics</h1>
<p local-id=3D"92236e33862c">Completed view retains outcomes (Completed, Re=
assigned, Reprioritized, Escalated, Cancelled) for future trend analysis an=
d delegation effectiveness reporting. In-Progress contributes to dashboard =
metrics but remains active until resolved.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"2b4832991f02" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93CombinedRequirements=
(MOM+InterviewSummary)-14.Non-Functional&amp;UIConsiderations">14. Non-Func=
tional &amp; UI Considerations</h1>
<p local-id=3D"d1a7113c4f70">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Apply Engage theme with darker neutrals to improve scannability wi=
thout overpowering UI.</p>
<p local-id=3D"28f72c1e25d7">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; &nbsp;Accessibility: clear status colours with sufficient contrast; keyb=
oard navigation for search and filtering.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4ce00b0e2237"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
